 A patrol's waypoints all lie in its city's rectangle.
  ct-patrol-ok : List CtCity, CtPatrol, Integer -> Boolean
  ct-patrol-ok (cities) (p) (i) = if p.city < 1 | p.city >= list-length cities | list-length p.xs /= 4 | list-length p.ys /= 4 then False
    else if i >= 4 then True
    else ct-city-at cities (list-at p.xs i) (list-at p.ys i) 0 == p.city & ct-patrol-ok cities p (i + 1)
